								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1113.msg11022#msg11022">I have no money.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> September 10, 2004, 11:18:26 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I&#039;m poor. I have no money. In fact, my bank account is overdrawn by $250. And I don&#039;t get paid until next Thursday. I&#039;m sick of not having money! It&#039;s like, if you don&#039;t have money, you can&#039;t *do* anything! This sucks.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
