								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=124158" target="_blank"><b>Spaerhawk</b></a> the Cynicalbastard<br />65 Paladin<br /><a href="http://www.unionofpower.org" target="_blank">Union of Power</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
