							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1113.msg11029#msg11029"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1113.msg11029#msg11029">Re: I have no money.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> September 10, 2004, 12:46:26 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Become a woman.&nbsp; Women can go out at night with no money and have a great time.&nbsp; Anymore they don&#039;t even realize that drinks at the bar cost money.&nbsp; Just show a little cleavage and enjoy&nbsp; the &quot;all you can drink for free&quot; special.&nbsp; We guys on the other hand... if we go out with no money we&#039;ll be very bored, very sober, and very lonely.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
